  "title": "Gingerbread Whoopie Pies",
  "description": "These spicy whoopie pies are flavored with cinnamon, ginger, and molasses. Filled with a cream cheese frosting, they make a fun treat.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2012-12-13T15:09:02-05:00",
